        "sections": [
          {
            "section_type": "example_question",
            "normalized_html": "<p>Express <span class=\"math\">[MATH: 7 \\times 7 \\times 7 \\times 7 \\times 7\\times 7]</span> using an exponent.</p>",
            "readable_text": "Express [MATH: 7 \\times 7 \\times 7 \\times 7 \\times 7\\times 7] using an exponent.",
            "images": [],
            "free_entry_blanks": [],
            "select_lists": []
          },
          {
            "section_type": "content",
            "normalized_html": "<p>EXPLANATION</p>",
            "readable_text": "EXPLANATION",
            "images": [],
            "free_entry_blanks": [],
            "select_lists": []
          },
          {
            "section_type": "example_explanation",
            "normalized_html": "<p>The number <span class=\"math\">[MATH: 7]</span> is multiplied by itself <span class=\"math\">[MATH: 6]</span> times, so we have</p><p><span class=\"math\">[MATH: \\underbrace{7 \\times 7 \\times 7 \\times 7 \\times 7\\times 7}_{\\large{\\color{blue}6} \\textrm{ copies of } 7} = 7^{\\color{blue}6}.]</span></p><p>Therefore, the answer is <span class=\"math\">[MATH: 7^6.]</span></p>",
            "readable_text": "The number [MATH: 7] is multiplied by itself [MATH: 6] times, so we have\n\n[MATH: \\underbrace{7 \\times 7 \\times 7 \\times 7 \\times 7\\times 7}_{\\large{\\color{blue}6} \\textrm{ copies of } 7} = 7^{\\color{blue}6}.]\n\nTherefore, the answer is [MATH: 7^6.]",
            "images": [],
            "free_entry_blanks": [],
            "select_lists": []
          }
        ],
        "images": [],
        "free_entry_blanks": [],
        "select_lists": [],
        "readable_text": "Example Prompt:\nExpress [MATH: 7 \\times 7 \\times 7 \\times 7 \\times 7\\times 7] using an exponent.\n\nContent:\nEXPLANATION\n\nExplanation:\nThe number [MATH: 7] is multiplied by itself [MATH: 6] times, so we have\n\n[MATH: \\underbrace{7 \\times 7 \\times 7 \\times 7 \\times 7\\times 7}_{\\large{\\color{blue}6} \\textrm{ copies of } 7} = 7^{\\color{blue}6}.]\n\nTherefore, the answer is [MATH: 7^6.]"
      },
