          {
            "section_type": "example_explanation",
            "normalized_html": "<p>The expression <span class=\"math\">[MATH: 3^4]</span> means <span class=\"math\">[MATH: 3]</span> multiplied by itself <span class=\"math\">[MATH: 4]</span> times. So we have</p><p><span class=\"math\">[MATH: 3^{4}|= (3 \u00d7 3) \u00d7 (3 \u00d7 3); = 9 \u00d7 9; = 81.]</span></p>",
